  "body": "Set well back from the road in a prime freehold Stanmore Bay pocket, 94 Brightside Road is a warm, inviting home where all the living happens effortlessly on one level. Blending timeless character-like rich hardwood flooring, a cosy wood-burner, and blooming cottage gardens-with modern kitchen and bathroom updates, it's ready for you to move in and enjoy. \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Single-Level Layout: 3 double bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a study nook.\r\n* Modern Kitchen: White cabinetry, subway tile splashback, breakfast bar, and garden outlooks.\r\n* Heating & Flooring: Wood-burner fireplace in the lounge, heat pump in the dining area, hardwood floors through the living spaces, and comfortable carpet in the bedrooms. \r\n* 3 Outdoor Decks: Morning and afternoon sun across three decks, including a large covered deck off the kitchen.\r\n* Established Gardens: Fully fenced backyard with level lawn, mature greenery, flowers, a garden archway, and a productive orchard of blueberries, mulberries, feijoas, citrus, nectarine, and plums.\r\n* Double Garage & Parking: Separate double garage plus large concrete off-street parking for extra vehicles or a boat.\r\n\r\nLeave the car parked! You're an easy walk to Stanmore Bay Beach, local parks, cafes, restaurants, the pharmacy, Coast Plaza, and supermarkets. Plus, Stanmore Bay School and Whangaparaoa College are right down the road-with convenient Penlink access adding extra future appeal.\r\n\r\nIdeal for young families wanting a safe fenced yard and walkable schools, retirees seeking single-level living, professional couples, or those working from home.\r\n\r\nReady to see it for yourself? Come to the open home or contact Zena Van Wijk today to arrange a private viewing!\r\n\r\nBuilding Report Available.\r\n\r\nOrewa: Auction: 4:00pm, Thursday 10th December 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa, (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
